    {
      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "author": "Asterlink SOC <soc@asterlinktransit.com>",
      "subject": "Expected hosts for the first discovery pass",
      "shortSummary": "The expected inventory for comparison with the approved-range scan.",
      "date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00",
      "body": "{player},\n\nRun the first discovery pass against 10.42.18.0/24. The expected inventory contains three hosts: the jump host at 10.42.18.10, public portal at 10.42.18.20, and signage API at 10.42.18.42. Document any additional response instead of assuming it belongs.\n\nUse tcpdump for ICMP during the discovery pass. If a host ignores ping, that does not prove it is down.\n\nAsterlink SOC",
      "attachements": []
    },
